WEBVTT

00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:32.126
Any ambitious journalist that age

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.747
aspires to work for one
of the big national papers,

00:00:34.771 --> 00:00:37.498
like "The New York Times"
or "The Wall Street Journal."

00:00:37.522 --> 00:00:39.403
But I was simply blown away

00:00:39.427 --> 00:00:42.094
by my first few weeks
at "The Denver Post,"

00:00:42.118 --> 00:00:45.102
and I thought,
"This is going to be my paper.

00:00:45.126 --> 00:00:47.456
I can make a career right here."

00:00:48.303 --> 00:00:50.318
Well, seven years passed,

00:00:50.342 --> 00:00:52.509
we were sold to a hedge fund,

00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:54.405
Alden Global Capital.

00:00:55.231 --> 00:00:56.913
Within a few years --

00:00:56.937 --> 00:00:58.103
(Laughs)

00:00:58.127 --> 00:00:59.840
(Laughter)

00:00:59.864 --> 00:01:01.291
Some of you know this story.